Basically, you coordinate according to
the fashion scene.

64
00:07:13,008 --> 00:07:17,508
時間内でコーディネートできるように練習するモード。
It's a mode to practice coordinating
within the time limit.

65
00:07:17,508 --> 00:07:22,008
まずは、ねねがお手本でやっていくから。
First, I'll show you how it's done.

66
