00:57:39,588 --> 00:57:44,588
君のごはんが食べたいよ
I want to eat your home-cooked meals

748
00:57:44,588 --> 00:57:49,088
もし君が帰ってきたら とびきりの笑顔で
If you come back home, with the biggest smile...

749
00:57:49,088 --> 00:57:53,088
抱きつくよ
I'll run and hug you tight

750
00:57:53,088 --> 00:57:58,088
君がいないと謝れないよ
Without you here, I can't even apologize

751
00:57:58,088 --> 00:58:02,588
君の声が聞きたいよ
I want to hear your voice

752
00:58:02,588 --> 00:58:07,088
君の笑顔が見れれば
If only I could see your smile,

753
00:58:07,088 --> 00:58:12,588
それだけでいいんだよ
that alone would be enough

754
00:58:12,588 --> 00:58:16,888
君がそばにいるだけで
Just having you by my side

755
00:58:16,888 --> 00:58:21,088
いつも勇気もらってた
always gave me courage

756
00:58:21,088 --> 00:58:25,888
いつまででも一緒にいたい
I want to be with you forever

757
00:58:25,888 --> 00:58:30,088
この気持ちを伝えたいよ
I want to tell you how I feel

758
00:58:30,088 --> 00:58:34,588
晴れの日も 雨の日も
Whether it's sunny or rainy,

759
00:58:34,588 --> 00:58:39,588
君はそばにいてくれた
you were always there by my side

760
00:58:39,588 --> 00:58:44,088
目を閉じれば 君の笑顔
If I close my eyes, your smile...

761
00:58:44,088 --> 00:58:48,588
輝いてる
is shining bright

762
00:59:02,588 --> 00:59:07,088
君がいないと何もわからないよ
Without you here, I don't know anything

763
00:59:07,088 --> 00:59:12,088
砂糖と醤油はどこだっけ？
Where are the sugar and soy sauce kept?

764
00:59:12,088 --> 00:59:16,088
もし君が帰ってきたら びっくりさせようとも結構
Even if I think of surprising you when you return,

765
00:59:16,088 --> 00:59:19,588
思ってたのにな
I realized that was just a passing thought

766
00:59:19,588 --> 00:59:24,588
君についつい甘えちゃうよ
I always find myself depending on you

767
00:59:24,588 --> 00:59:29,088
君が優しすぎるから
Because you are just way too kind

768
00:59:29,088 --> 00:59:34,088
君にもらってばかりで
I'm always on the receiving end,

769
00:59:34,088 --> 00:59:39,088
何もあげられてないよ
and I haven't been able to give you anything back

770
00:59:39,088 --> 00:59:43,588
君がそばにいることを
Having you by my side...

771
00:59:43,588 --> 00:59:47,888
当たり前に思ってた固定
I had started to take it for granted

772
00:59:47,888 --> 00:59:52,588
こんな日々がずっとずっと
I thought these days would go on

773
00:59:52,588 --> 00:59:57,088
続くんだと思ってたよ
forever and ever

774
00:59:57,088 --> 01:00:00,088
ごめん、今は気づ...
I'm sorry, now I rea...

775
01:00:00,096 --> 01:00:01,896
気づいたよ
...I realized

776
01:00:01,896 --> 01:00:06,596
あたりまえじゃないことに
that it's not something to be taken for granted.

777
01:00:06,596 --> 01:00:10,596
まずはキミに伝えなくちゃ
First, I must tell you...

778
01:00:10,596 --> 01:00:15,596
ありがとう
...thank you.

779
01:00:18,096 --> 01:00:20,596
ありがとう！届いてるかー？！
Thank you! Is it reaching you?!

780
01:00:21,296 --> 01:00:24,096
聞こえてますかー？！
Can you hear us?!

781
01:00:30,096 --> 01:00:33,096
超元気でやってます！
We're performing with super energy!

782
01:00:38,596 --> 01:00:42,596
キミの胸に届くかな
Will it reach your heart?

783
01:00:43,096 --> 01:00:47,596
今は自信ないけれど
I don't have much confidence right now, but...

784
01:00:47,596 --> 01:00:52,096
笑わないで どうか聞いて
Please don't laugh, just listen.

785
01:00:52,096 --> 01:00:55,596
想いを歌に込めたから
Because I put my feelings into this song.

786
01:00:56,096 --> 01:01:01,096
ありったけの ありがとう
With all the gratitude I can give,

787
01:01:01,096 --> 01:01:05,596
歌に乗せて 届けたい
I want to deliver it on this song.

788
01:01:05,596 --> 01:01:09,596
この気持ちは ずっとずっと
These feelings, forever and ever,

789
01:01:09,596 --> 01:01:14,596
忘れないよ
I will never forget them.

790
01:01:14,596 --> 01:01:19,096
想いよ 届け
May my feelings reach you!

791
01:01:41,596 --> 01:01:43,096
ジャン、ジャン、ジャン、ジャン！
Strum, strum, strum, strum!

792
01:01:44,296 --> 01:01:45,396
もう一回！
One more time!

793
01:01:45,596 --> 01:01:47,596
ジャン、ジャン、ジャン、ジャン！
Strum, strum, strum, strum!

794
01:01:54,096 --> 01:03:09,096
やばい！やばい！やばい！やばい！桃鈴ねね生誕2024 遊んでみた
[Text: Yabai! Yabai! Yabai! Yabai! Momosuzu Nene Birthday 2024 - Played Around]

